# org-policy-drift

A CLI tool to detect drift between declared org standards and actual repo configuration.

## Usage

```bash
org-policy-drift init                              # creates .org-policy.yaml
org-policy-drift scan --org <org> --policy <file>  # scan all repos
org-policy-drift scan --org <org> --policy <file> --json   # JSON output
org-policy-drift scan --org <org> --policy <file> --fail-on-drift  # CI gate
```

## Exit Codes

- `0`: No drift detected
- `1`: Drift detected (or error)
